Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:29.46,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Saraba chikyuu yo, ai suru hito yo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:29.46,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Farewell Earth, and to the ones we love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:37.97,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:37.97,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato}Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:38.01,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx150\fscy120\c&H000000&\move(342,350,318,348,1,4380)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.86,0:00:38.01,yamato,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\fscx347\fscy257\pos(868,926)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:38.01,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:43.26,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikyuu wo sukuu shimei o obite tatakau otoko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:43.26,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.26,0:00:46.01,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.26,0:00:46.01,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:52.66,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:52.66,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:01:01.11,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:01:01.11,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:08.45,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:08.45,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:15.47,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:15.47,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:44.91,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Main engine output rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:46.21,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Good. It's stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.51,0:02:11.16,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The Yamato has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:13.61,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Strange…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:18.85,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,What gives them such motivation ?{es them so well ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.59,0:02:46.77,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,There's no end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:49.31,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Front guards, focus on the "Needles" coming from ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.31,0:02:51.26,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Rear guards, aim at the enemy above.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:52.31,def2,MEN,0,0,0,,Roger !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:09.22,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:16.41,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}The power of fate connects the ship and us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:32.44,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Those ghosts don't know their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:35.81,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Telezart defense fleet annihilation confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:39.58,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Vital signs of both of the Goland bodies are lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:43.11,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,Gather all divisions !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:45.81,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,Annihilate them along with the \Nadvanced unit that landed earlier !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:47.81,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.30,0:03:53.99,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,Indeed, life is unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:59.66,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,Until my time comes, I'll hold onto \Nthe hope of survival to fulfill my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:03.70,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,Hear that, Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:12.74,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Second landing team, move out !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:17.66,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Space Cavalry, prepare to \Nreceive special equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:18.41,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:22.31,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Can't we just destroy the\N rock bed with the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:28.37,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The main guns are inadequate, and the \Nwave motion gun would destroy Telezart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.03,0:04:32.48,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,We must depend on the wave motion\N excavator the First Officer developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:37.07,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Believe in Kodai and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:01.07,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,Akira…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:02.77,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:08.71,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,You'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:14.30,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,That person says you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:16.30,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,That person…?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:19.66,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Enemy unit approaching from 9 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:22.63,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}It's the Medarusa class modified tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:37.65,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Ensign Yamamoto, we'll hold our ground, \Nso secure the safety of yourself and the injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.65,0:05:38.53,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:42.06,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Spread out, engage at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:43.33,def2,MEN,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:50.53,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Is it unmanned ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:53.61,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Take this !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:03.93,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,These are unmanned.\N Aim for the control system on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:05.20,def2,MEN,0,0,0,,Got it !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:09.14,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Die, die, die, die already !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:39.93,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Did we manage to hold out ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:44.53,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Deputy Commander, a number of enemy\N reinforcement units detected 10 kilometers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.53,0:06:45.59,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:49.93,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,That many ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.39,0:06:54.93,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}What're you going to do, Deputy Commander ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:58.11,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious ?\N Don't let them come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:02.56,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Roger that. \NWe can't let the Yamato crew die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:04.82,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We can finally pay off our debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:06.26,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Exactly. {overlap Yatteyarimashou=Let's do it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:08.29,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{Ichido}We were supposed to die back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.29,0:07:11.46,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Hold on !\N Nagakura, sorry for making you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:13.01,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:16.39,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Everyone, leave the area immediately !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.89,0:07:25.59,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Take this !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.19,0:07:34.03,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:36.31,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Those small "Needles" will come. \Nwatch yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:37.63,def2,MEN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:08.71,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:13.05,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,But when humans act like that, \Nthere's always something else going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:21.25,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,Fire the Helvestia Cannon. {BTW, Helvestia is the name of the land ship.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:36.81,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,They know about us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:39.40,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,Damn, why can't it be more accurate ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:46.45,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Half of the relays were lost because of the Yamato's wave motion gun. The current accuracy is our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.45,0:08:50.15,def2,ZAVIVAL…because,0,0,0,,It's only a copy after all ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:51.45,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,Dammit !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:59.23,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Reflective Satellite Cannon ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:00.41,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,How ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:02.50,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,They stole Garmillas technology ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:08.48,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,They captured Garmillas scientists to develop weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:15.41,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Keyman, if that's the case, the basic controls must be derived from Garmillas ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:23.66,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,We don't have time to \Ndestroy each and every satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:26.56,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Just destroy the relay control satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:31.07,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,If we trace this control signal,\N we can find the target's location, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:33.01,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.23,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:40.46,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Pull back !\NAll units, retreat to the rendezvous point !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:54.99,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}It's dangerous !\NPlease evacuate !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:56.71,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:03.71,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Is that it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.34,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,An identical copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.71,0:10:20.46,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Those who steal someone else's property...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:22.71,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...deserve to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:39.35,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,What the hell…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.23,0:10:45.11,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Destroyed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:48.00,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,300 seconds till explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:49.56,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Good !\N Let's get out of here !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:55.32,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}All personnel, head to the\N rendezvous point at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:58.95,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Guys, you heard that.\N The rock bed will explode soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:00.66,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,The surface…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:01.81,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Commander !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.67,0:11:10.22,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Here comes the big boss, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:14.69,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Everyone, get down !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:39.33,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:44.74,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We've lost Ohmiya and Yahata's vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:48.71,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Anyone with functional weapons ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:53.78,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}All units' output is down to 20% because of the\N interference wave of the wave motion resonance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:56.51,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.51,0:12:00.66,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,All units, withdraw immediately.\N Get out before the second shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:01.67,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:02.73,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Nagakura…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.73,0:12:04.05,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Yes, Commander ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:06.31,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Go on ahead. I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:12.91,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Six…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.91,0:12:13.91,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,…five…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:14.91,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,…four…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.91,0:12:15.91,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,…three…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.91,0:12:16.91,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,…two…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.91,0:12:17.25,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,…one…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:34.66,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Shockwave is spreading throughout the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.66,0:12:37.71,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The sealing rock beds are\N breaking up due to a chain reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:12.66,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,Zantz Zarvival.\N That's my inherited name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:13.75,def2,ZAVIVAL,0,0,0,,And you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:19.59,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Saito Hajime, a space cavalryman. \NYou killed my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:12.31,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Self destruct ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:14.56,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Like hell !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:01.62,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What the hell ?! Friggin' idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:30.41,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Course clear.\N We can descend to Terezalium.{Terezalium}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.43,0:15:36.69,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,The source of Teresa's message. \NUse caution, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.09,0:15:38.16,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Without the sun, how…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:02.77,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,That must act like the sun, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:05.41,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:08.63,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Is Teresa inside it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:12.85,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What was Gatlantis trying to do here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:14.56,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.54,0:16:30.52,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.98,0:16:53.33,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Teresa. That's Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:05.56,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,I am Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:08.63,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,Teresa of Telezart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:15.73,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Teresa, we received your message, \Nand came all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:19.21,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.21,0:17:22.50,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You could have sent your \Nmessage to anyone in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.97,0:17:26.01,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,I didn't make the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:30.81,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,The Yamato was destined to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:32.16,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Destined ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.56,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What do you mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:39.82,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Teresa, you're a higher dimensional life-form who resides in the upper dimension, aren't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:43.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Higher dimensional life-form ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:51.61,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We have to come to this place in\N order to hear your real voice, correct ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:59.81,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,Yes. You can hear my voice only\N when you're in my dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:04.21,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,The Terezalium is a gate for that purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:09.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The people of Telezart gave up on their \Nbodies and crossed the gate to heaven alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:13.49,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{sono}Teresa, you're their collective mind.{ of them.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:20.15,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{anata}You reside between this world and the afterworld, \Nwatching the universe from its beginning to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:25.48,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,She lives in the world\Nwhere time can be visualized.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:28.74,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We're standing at the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:30.74,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Entrance ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:33.71,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Are we at the entrance to Heaven ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.65,0:18:39.03,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Then what's destined to happen to the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:43.73,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,You know of the White Comet, don't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:47.86,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yes, we regard it as the Gatlantian home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:53.78,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,It is a relic of the ancient Archelians from long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:19:02.45,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,As they planted the seeds of human life throughout space, they prepared safeguards, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:11.31,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,If the seeded lives develop in the wrong direction,\N a device would destroy each and every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.77,0:19:14.85,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Then Gatlantis is…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:18.66,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,All living things have one purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:20.72,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,It's to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:30.66,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,But Gatlantis is different. \NThey revived the ark of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:38.66,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,Their advancement will not stop until they've annihilated all human life in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:46.90,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,You must confront the White Comet Empire…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:53.70,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{chikyuu}…not only for Earth, but also\N for all living things in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:57.98,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,And you already know the outcome, don't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:19:59.09,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Saito, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:03.41,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,If I tell you about the future, it will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:06.02,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,That would be overstepping my bounds.{'s too much of an overreach.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:08.46,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:14.85,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,Those who have abandoned physical bodies\N shouldn't intervene in the world of physical entities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:19.88,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{watashi}All I'm allowed to do is pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:27.27,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,A god-like civilization has left a destructive device…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:32.57,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We don't know if we can defeat\N them even with the entire Earth force.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:37.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Any hints ? \NCan we have any hints for the battle ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:54.28,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,You came here, which means\N you and I are bound by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.09,0:21:00.76,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,"Yamato" means great harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:02.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Great harmony…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:08.47,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,Harmony is a field created by\Nthe lives brought together by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:13.80,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{en}Fate is a power that connects dissimilar entities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:22.53,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{juryoku}Like how gravity works, fate connects events by acting across the wall of dimensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.71,0:21:29.81,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{en}The power of fate exceeds any laws of physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.19,0:21:37.47,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{dorehodo}It can't be overturned no matter \Nhow powerful the protection may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:42.71,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,Great harmony…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:48.10,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,The Yamato is at the center of fate,\N and it will stop the ark of doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:51.36,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Teresa…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.02,0:21:57.17,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,Fate grows…painfully at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:02.99,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,With him as well.{Same for him.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.56,0:22:38.40,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,It's been a while, gentlemen of the Yamato.
